WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:07.440
<b>Since the cannibalism incident...</b>

00:00.740 --> 00:07.440
In recognition of the Armed Detective Agency's
 considerable contributions

00:05.540 --> 00:07.440
<b>One month has passed.</b>

00:07.440 --> 00:09.690
Futsuma Shikyu Award Ceremony

00:07.860 --> 00:12.610
to the safety of the city and people of 
Yokohama during the White Whale Incident,

00:12.610 --> 00:15.320
we award the Futsuma Shikyu Award.

00:20.330 --> 00:23.320
Your Agency is the pride of our nation.

00:24.740 --> 00:28.810
Has a private company ever been 
awarded the Shikyu Award?

00:28.810 --> 00:30.260
It's easy to see why.

00:30.580 --> 00:35.330
They captured Pushkin and Fyodor after 
the European authorities failed to do so.

00:35.610 --> 00:38.760
Rumor has it that the
 Detective Agency's been tapped

00:38.760 --> 00:41.590
as special advisers to the 
municipal police combat squad.

00:41.590 --> 00:45.360
If that's true, the Special Investigation 
Department has fresh mud on its face.

00:45.360 --> 00:47.610
They have no reason to be ashamed.

00:47.610 --> 00:51.770
That's just how capable the 
Armed Detective Agency is.

00:51.770 --> 00:54.200
Well, hello, Assistant Senior Attorney.

00:54.200 --> 00:55.800
This is unofficial,

00:55.800 --> 01:00.500
but it was the Detective Agency that 
prevented the crash of the whale airship.

01:00.500 --> 01:01.780
That's impressive.

01:02.250 --> 01:04.770
I believe that, soon enough, 
the Armed Detective Agency

01:04.770 --> 01:08.510
will be carrying the weight of 
this nation's center of power.

02:44.110 --> 02:47.270
I told you to stop attacking head-on.

02:47.270 --> 02:48.530
But...

02:48.530 --> 02:50.240
Don't let your power control you.

02:50.510 --> 02:54.390
It's when you're drowning in the 
tiger's power that you always lose.

02:54.820 --> 02:59.280
To put it bluntly: the tiger is strong, 
but you're weak.

03:02.060 --> 03:03.650
It's time for work.

03:03.650 --> 03:04.700
Let's go.

03:05.790 --> 03:07.420
A murder society?

03:07.420 --> 03:08.530
Yes.

03:08.530 --> 03:10.410
It's an urgent request from the government.

03:10.410 --> 03:12.330
First, here's a photo of the victim.

03:13.960 --> 03:14.950
Terrible.

03:15.310 --> 03:17.580
The victim was a young diet member.

03:17.910 --> 03:21.290
As you can see, the victim had the 
skin of his upper body torn off

03:21.290 --> 03:22.960
and was forced to wear it inside out.

03:22.960 --> 03:25.530
He's got some interesting taste, doesn't he?

03:25.530 --> 03:28.980
There have been four such incidents in the 
past week, perpetrated by the same culprit.

03:29.410 --> 03:31.660
The vice commander of the Coast Guard.

03:31.660 --> 03:34.270
Killed by a powerful corrosive
 being poured on his head.

03:34.620 --> 03:37.260
Ministry of Defense External Defense, 
Department Chief Secretary

03:37.730 --> 03:41.310
Injected with high density 
air using an air compressor,

03:41.310 --> 03:43.910
leading to expulsion of all blood 
from his pores and subsequent death.

03:44.200 --> 03:53.080
<b><i>kill me</i></b>

03:44.560 --> 03:46.540
Lastly, a top military envoy.

03:47.190 --> 03:50.060
An intensely pain-inducing plant from
 South America, known as the suicide weed,

03:50.060 --> 03:52.690
was implanted in his armpit. 
He was then locked in a room.

03:53.080 --> 03:57.040
He slammed his own head against the wall, 
causing cerebral contusion and death.

03:57.410 --> 03:58.660
Aha...

03:58.660 --> 04:00.200
The Decay of Angels.

04:00.200 --> 04:01.890
It's a message from the murderer.

04:01.890 --> 04:03.600
The Decay of Angels?

04:04.090 --> 04:05.890
The Decay of Angels...

04:05.890 --> 04:09.930
refers to the five signs that angels, at the 
pinnacle of the sixth path of existence,

04:09.930 --> 04:12.170
exhibit before their death.

04:12.170 --> 04:12.940
President.

04:13.260 --> 04:16.800
The robe becomes stained with grime and oils.

04:17.140 --> 04:20.570
The crown wilts and rots.

04:20.860 --> 04:24.390
The body becomes dirty and odorous.

04:24.690 --> 04:28.590
Sweat pours out of the armpits.

04:28.590 --> 04:32.180
So this is a serial murder making
 a deliberate display of brutality?

04:32.180 --> 04:33.480
Just a second.

04:33.480 --> 04:35.050
There have only been four murders.

04:35.320 --> 04:38.290
Of the five omens, 
dissatisfaction and apathy remain.

04:38.720 --> 04:40.810
Therefore, there's going to be one more murder.

04:40.810 --> 04:41.770
There will not.

04:42.110 --> 04:44.420
We will stop it before it happens.

04:44.830 --> 04:47.670
We will all commit to putting 
an end to this villain's scheme.

04:48.270 --> 04:49.260
I disagree.

04:51.100 --> 04:53.220
Rampo. Your reason?

04:53.220 --> 04:54.950
My friend gave me a warning.

04:54.950 --> 04:57.470
The Detective Agency is about
 to get a huge job offer!

04:57.470 --> 04:58.390
Don't accept it!

04:58.940 --> 05:01.110
If you do, it'll be the end of the Agency!

05:03.160 --> 05:04.650
I'm turning down this job.

05:05.940 --> 05:08.790
Have you seen the 
Futsuma Shikyu Award in my office?

05:09.210 --> 05:13.250
That is the honor of the century for 
those of us who protect people.

05:13.250 --> 05:15.830
You're telling me to take the 
job because we got a bow?

05:15.830 --> 05:16.660
No.

05:17.400 --> 05:20.380
That is just a piece of wood.

05:20.750 --> 05:24.390
Awards and accolades are 
no more than set dressing.

05:24.390 --> 05:27.500
Even if we were honorless 
thieves in a basement,

05:27.500 --> 05:30.250
we would risk our lives to stop this murder.

05:31.030 --> 05:33.490
Do what you want, then.

05:33.490 --> 05:34.330
Rampo-san!

05:34.330 --> 05:35.690
Don't stop him, Kunikida.

05:36.320 --> 05:38.690
The Agency will pursue the murderer.

05:38.690 --> 05:42.690
And Rampo will pursue the facts 
behind the Agency's coming demise.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.320
A dual investigation.

05:44.580 --> 05:48.410
Rampo knows full-well that's 
the most optimal solution.

05:46.030 --> 05:49.030
<b><i>Episode 42</i></b>

05:46.030 --> 05:49.030
<b><i>Tragic Sunday</i></b>

05:50.420 --> 05:55.160
Apathy and dissatisfaction 
with one's position...

05:58.860 --> 05:59.670
Yes?

05:59.670 --> 06:01.200
<i>This is Sakaguchi of the 
Special Operations Division.</i>

06:01.870 --> 06:04.500
I have been unable to contact Dazai-kun.

06:04.500 --> 06:06.350
Do you happen to know his whereabouts?

06:06.770 --> 06:07.720
<i>No.</i>

06:07.720 --> 06:13.580
Then please convey a message to the Agency 
staff regarding the serial murder victims:

06:13.580 --> 06:16.310
There is evidence that the victims' 
bodyguard rosters and itineraries

06:16.310 --> 06:20.520
were tampered with and
 modified by government figures.

06:21.310 --> 06:27.190
<i>It may be that the Decay of Angels is the 
alternate identity of a government body.</i>

06:27.530 --> 06:28.680
<i>Please be careful.</i>

06:30.130 --> 06:31.280
Hey, there.

06:32.210 --> 06:34.810
You're from the Department of Justice.

06:34.810 --> 06:36.300
I appreciate your hard work.

06:36.300 --> 06:38.870
You're a newcomer at the 
Detective Agency, aren't you?

06:38.870 --> 06:40.740
How's the investigation coming?

06:41.210 --> 06:45.760
We're going through the entire list
 of dangerous Gifted, but nothing yet.

06:45.760 --> 06:47.920
Who were you on the phone with?

06:47.920 --> 06:49.180
Oh, that was...

06:49.850 --> 06:54.350
There's evidence they were tampered 
with by government figures.

06:56.530 --> 06:59.940
Oh, I was just asked to 
run a few more errands.

06:59.940 --> 07:00.930
Never mind me.

07:01.360 --> 07:03.180
What brings you here, sir?

07:03.180 --> 07:09.240
Oh, I just happened to spot you as I was 
enjoying coffee at the shop over there.

07:09.510 --> 07:11.610
<i>I can use my tiger's sense of smell.</i>

07:15.730 --> 07:17.810
<i>I don't smell coffee.</i>

07:18.470 --> 07:19.290
Is something the matter?

07:19.290 --> 07:21.150
No, nothing at all!

07:21.150 --> 07:24.830
Anyway, I have to go feed the 
boss's chameleon and stuff.

07:24.830 --> 07:25.860
Pardon me!

07:28.990 --> 07:30.140
That's fine.

07:30.140 --> 07:35.430
The Armed Detective Agency's 
doom today is already decided.

07:42.060 --> 07:44.540
Which horse came in first?

07:46.650 --> 07:49.150
<i>I see. He's blind.</i>

07:49.710 --> 07:50.890
Number Nine.

07:50.890 --> 07:52.150
Thank you.

07:52.150 --> 07:53.970
You won, didn't you?

07:53.970 --> 07:55.310
Oh, can you tell?

07:55.310 --> 07:56.450
Yes.

07:56.450 --> 07:59.790
Your sweat, body temperature, 
the sound of your muscles...

07:59.790 --> 08:03.270
There's more that I can see, 
now that I've lost my sight.

08:03.270 --> 08:05.620
I can even predict your fate tomorrow.

08:07.080 --> 08:09.660
You won't have a tomorrow,

08:09.660 --> 08:12.350
former Port Mafia Executive, Dazai Osamu.

08:12.600 --> 08:15.160
138 counts of aggravated murder.

08:15.160 --> 08:17.220
312 counts of intimidation.

08:17.220 --> 08:21.030
A total of 625 charges, including fraud 
and more, for which I'm arresting you.

08:21.770 --> 08:25.720
Gentlemen, the Hunting Dogs have arrested 
one of the members of the Agency.

08:25.720 --> 08:26.770
Ah!

08:26.770 --> 08:27.980
Finally.

08:27.980 --> 08:29.680
Sheltering the murderer of 35.

08:29.980 --> 08:31.390
Association with the Mafia.

08:31.690 --> 08:33.300
The female doctor is suspected 
of murdering a patient

08:33.300 --> 08:35.000
during her time as a combat medic.

08:35.380 --> 08:38.580
We shall expose them for these crimes 
and dismantle the Detective Agency.

08:38.580 --> 08:42.050
This is the moment our 
organization has waited for.

08:46.540 --> 08:47.690
Tonan-sensei.

08:48.570 --> 08:50.500
I've gathered the documents.

08:51.160 --> 08:53.190
Orders sent to Fukuzawa for the assassination

08:53.190 --> 08:56.000
of pro-war individuals at the end of the war.

08:56.000 --> 09:00.380
The Armed Detective Agency won't 
survive the publication of this information.

09:00.380 --> 09:02.340
And the list of targets for assassination?

09:02.340 --> 09:03.620
Right here.

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
Top 
Secret

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
m 0 0 l 30 0 30 30 0 30

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
Key Figures

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
m 0 0 l 73 0 74 15 0 15

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
Tonan Buzan

09:06.230 --> 09:07.900
m 0 0 l 50 0 50 15 0 15

09:10.750 --> 09:11.860
<i>Father...</i>

09:11.860 --> 09:14.470
<i>I can finally avenge you.</i>

09:15.250 --> 09:17.870
I must thank the providers 
of this information.

09:18.390 --> 09:22.870
Though, it's still unclear how they 
managed to get it.

09:23.440 --> 09:25.780
I ought to meet with them in person.

09:25.780 --> 09:28.510
I've already arranged for an interview.

09:28.510 --> 09:29.440
Oh?

09:29.440 --> 09:29.870
When?

09:30.560 --> 09:31.830
Right now.

09:39.730 --> 09:42.650
Thank you for all you've done for 
me these past six months, sir.

09:43.090 --> 09:44.970
Now, then, quiz time!

09:44.970 --> 09:49.110
Why didn't I kill you just now?

09:49.110 --> 09:51.910
The answer is: because you're going to hate

09:51.910 --> 09:54.560
going back to your own 
station before you die!

09:56.560 --> 09:58.530
You got me.

09:58.530 --> 10:00.620
I knew I was being tracked,

10:00.620 --> 10:04.810
but I guess hiding in a crowd was
 no use against the Hunting Dogs.

10:04.810 --> 10:07.050
You're going to take me out 
along with the whole crowd.

10:07.340 --> 10:09.870
I can hear your rage.

10:09.870 --> 10:13.140
Soon it'll turn into fear of your punishment.

10:13.560 --> 10:15.750
I can't wait for that moment.

10:15.750 --> 10:18.100
We're going to get along great.

10:18.360 --> 10:23.310
Just tell me one thing: 
why did you come arrest me now?

10:23.310 --> 10:26.160
Fingerprints, recordings, photos...

10:26.730 --> 10:30.400
All manner of evidence suddenly reemerged,

10:30.820 --> 10:33.640
as though a switch had just been thrown.

10:37.350 --> 10:40.530
It was about my special 
ability from the beginning.

10:40.820 --> 10:46.030
You wanted to reverse a perfect 
murder and restore guilt.

10:46.030 --> 10:48.590
That's why you lured me in.

10:49.790 --> 10:50.730
<i>Huy!</i>

10:50.730 --> 10:52.340
<i>What's upsy-daisy!</i>

10:52.340 --> 10:57.650
<i>So, Armed Detective Agency, I'm going 
to give you four pieces of information.</i>

10:57.650 --> 10:58.830
<i>First!</i>

10:59.120 --> 11:02.510
<i>I restrained government 
bigwigs with fun machines.</i>

11:02.510 --> 11:05.460
<i>It's the chainsaw human disassembly show!</i>

11:05.810 --> 11:08.010
<i>As soon as the time comes, 
he'll be cut clean into two!</i>

11:08.010 --> 11:09.810
Dissatisfaction and apathy.

11:09.810 --> 11:10.980
<i>Second!</i>

11:11.270 --> 11:13.750
<i>If someone who isn't a member 
of the Detective Agency comes in,</i>

11:13.750 --> 11:15.600
<i>the chainsaw will activate automatically.</i>

11:16.200 --> 11:17.460
<i>Third!</i>

11:17.460 --> 11:20.250
<i>The chainsaw will activate at exactly 6 PM.</i>

11:20.770 --> 11:22.520
<i>And fourth...</i>

11:24.860 --> 11:25.910
<i>Dammit!</i>

11:25.910 --> 11:27.940
<i>I just realized there isn't a fourth!</i>

11:27.940 --> 11:29.470
<i>Oh, no!</i>

11:29.470 --> 11:30.030
<i>You!</i>

11:30.030 --> 11:31.070
<i>Any ideas?</i>

11:31.070 --> 11:33.200
<i>Crap, this is an on-air oopsie!</i>

11:33.650 --> 11:34.490
<i>Stop the camera!</i>

11:34.490 --> 11:35.520
<i>The camera!</i>

11:37.590 --> 11:39.000
Thirty more minutes.

11:39.740 --> 11:41.480
Understood.

11:41.870 --> 11:43.360
Be careful.

11:43.360 --> 11:46.680
Given he's demanding that an
 Agency member enters first,

11:46.680 --> 11:49.050
you'd be crazy not to suspect a trap.

11:49.310 --> 11:52.660
<i>Do you have any idea what they're after?</i>

11:53.260 --> 11:54.930
I got this.

11:54.930 --> 11:56.770
I'm standing in front of the clue right now.

12:02.820 --> 12:03.910
I smell blood.

12:08.940 --> 12:10.010
Chief Taneda!

12:11.270 --> 12:15.330
Fukuzawa's detective kid...

12:17.370 --> 12:20.550
I know what Decay of Angels is after.

12:23.700 --> 12:27.300
It'll take at least ten minutes 
for all of us to arrive.

12:27.910 --> 12:31.610
You are to go in first and
 stop the timer device.

12:32.080 --> 12:34.590
<i>It might be dangerous to 
charge in from the front.</i>

12:35.360 --> 12:39.120
<i>I think I'll have to use the 
underground escape route.</i>

12:46.820 --> 12:49.740
You're even more nimble 
than you're rumored to be,

12:50.050 --> 12:51.320
Tiger boy.

12:52.640 --> 12:54.540
My name is Nikolai!

12:55.090 --> 12:57.290
Okies, it's quiz time!

12:57.290 --> 12:59.160
What is my special ability?

13:00.800 --> 13:03.300
<i>The hand he has in his cape 
shows up elsewhere in space.</i>

13:04.110 --> 13:06.270
A matter teleportation ability?

13:06.270 --> 13:08.130
Bingo!

13:08.610 --> 13:12.580
My special ability lets me connect my cape 
with a point somewhere else in space.

13:12.580 --> 13:14.850
I have a range of roughly 30 meters.

13:15.130 --> 13:17.550
<i>So, even if I hide, he'll still shoot me.</i>

13:17.550 --> 13:18.850
Fine!

13:18.850 --> 13:20.150
Yipes.

13:23.820 --> 13:24.870
Tiger fangs!

13:24.870 --> 13:26.580
You're mine!

13:31.910 --> 13:34.860
I went and dropped a utility 
pole from the surface.

13:37.050 --> 13:41.800
Decay of Angels is a criminal 
organization comprised of five people.

13:42.380 --> 13:43.960
Jester Nikolai.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.260
Demon Fyodor.

13:45.570 --> 13:49.050
And three more special rank, 
dangerous Gifted.

13:49.050 --> 13:54.390
We'll wipe out all the Gifted 
rotting this country's foundations.

13:54.390 --> 13:56.270
I see.

13:56.270 --> 14:01.100
V is an organization of Gifted 
brought together to drive out Gifted.

14:02.000 --> 14:03.710
<i>V as in <i>five</i>.</i>

14:03.710 --> 14:06.460
<i>The five death omens of an angel!</i>

14:06.460 --> 14:11.920
And one of them has the ability to exchange 
information that the others want.

14:12.210 --> 14:14.580
That's who wounded me.

14:14.580 --> 14:15.730
So then...

14:15.730 --> 14:17.440
They stole information.

14:17.790 --> 14:19.190
From here.

14:20.470 --> 14:23.670
On the other hand, 
I learned what their goal is.

14:23.670 --> 14:26.000
I'm going to contact the 
Special Operations Division.

14:26.000 --> 14:26.990
You need a doctor.

14:26.990 --> 14:28.090
Listen to me!

14:28.090 --> 14:32.920
They've used my memories to 
steal a page from a book.

14:32.920 --> 14:33.980
A page?

14:34.290 --> 14:38.710
A blank novel that makes anything 
written in it become reality.

14:38.710 --> 14:43.990
It's a page from that book, 
torn out to use for research.

14:46.240 --> 14:49.330
<i>His special ability is strong.</i>

14:49.640 --> 14:52.900
Guess I'll just go ahead and restrain you.

14:57.170 --> 14:59.360
<i>It's not just powerful in combat.</i>

14:59.850 --> 15:03.740
<i>This ability could be used for raids, 
burglary, eavesdropping, abduction...</i>

15:03.740 --> 15:05.120
<i>He could do anything.</i>

15:05.120 --> 15:08.090
<i>He's the one who killed 
the government officials!</i>

15:10.230 --> 15:11.340
Why?

15:12.010 --> 15:13.820
Why do you kill people?

15:13.820 --> 15:15.790
And so horribly?

15:17.620 --> 15:20.940
The four I killed asked 
me that same question.

15:21.320 --> 15:24.850
And I have two answers.

15:24.850 --> 15:27.920
This is the first one: because it's fun!

15:29.520 --> 15:33.580
Because it's so damn fun 
and gets me so excited!

15:33.970 --> 15:36.200
Sounds like a plausible answer, doesn't it?

15:36.200 --> 15:39.010
You're killed by a monster 
without a speck of humanity.

15:39.010 --> 15:40.940
It's an injustice, 
but it's easy to understand.

15:40.940 --> 15:42.870
You can die with a sense of closure.

15:43.350 --> 15:46.030
But you aren't a monster's victim
 when I murder you.

15:46.600 --> 15:50.160
So I'll tell you the second, real reason.

15:51.230 --> 15:53.540
I'm perfectly sane.

15:54.090 --> 15:59.000
I understand how evil killing is and
 feel as much guilt as anyone.

16:00.070 --> 16:01.940
Do you like birds?

16:03.150 --> 16:05.210
I love them.

16:05.210 --> 16:08.610
They fly, unbound whatsoever 
by gravity. Total freedom.

16:09.030 --> 16:10.800
That's my wish.

16:11.320 --> 16:13.360
That's why I joined Decay of Angels.

16:14.310 --> 16:18.340
The page stolen by Decay of Angels

16:18.340 --> 16:21.760
has the same power as the book itself.

16:22.160 --> 16:25.210
But there's a rule to using the book.

16:25.210 --> 16:31.260
What's written in it must have the 
causal consistency of a novel.

16:31.980 --> 16:34.740
For some reason, a narrative-like 
logical consistency

16:34.740 --> 16:38.230
is required for it to be 
able to overwrite reality.

16:38.230 --> 16:42.530
That must have been how it was created, 
by whomever it was that had such an ability.

16:42.900 --> 16:46.430
Though, I suppose, since you can't just write

16:46.430 --> 16:50.200
"One day, humanity was doomed" and expect 
it to come true, it's a good rule.

16:50.860 --> 16:52.670
Chief Taneda!

16:52.670 --> 16:54.830
Abandon the mission and run.

16:55.120 --> 16:59.480
They intend to use the Agency 
as the catalyst of doom.

17:00.340 --> 17:02.110
The freedom of a bird?

17:02.110 --> 17:04.450
That's what you kill for?

17:04.450 --> 17:05.870
I don't get it at all!

17:06.180 --> 17:07.570
I'm sure you don't.

17:07.570 --> 17:10.590
In the end, Fyodor-kun was 
the only one who did.

17:11.090 --> 17:13.580
Okay, next question!

17:14.200 --> 17:17.250
When did I start lying in what I just said?

17:19.700 --> 17:21.440
Did I fool you?

17:21.440 --> 17:24.200
You shouldn't lend your ear to a jester!

17:24.200 --> 17:26.090
You won't be able to sleep at night.

17:26.350 --> 17:27.460
Now...

17:27.460 --> 17:28.560
You can have your leg back.

17:30.860 --> 17:32.560
<i>My leg's stuck in the ground!</i>

17:32.560 --> 17:33.540
<i>I can't get it out!</i>

17:33.540 --> 17:35.940
And thus ends the show.

17:35.940 --> 17:37.870
I hope you'll visit again.

17:40.490 --> 17:41.610
Stop!

17:45.880 --> 17:47.080
Time?

17:47.420 --> 17:48.850
Five more minutes.

17:50.040 --> 17:51.130
Military police...

17:51.570 --> 17:54.670
If anyone besides the Detective Agency 
enters, the hostages die.

17:55.020 --> 17:57.220
Kenji, stop the military police.

17:57.220 --> 17:58.170
Roger.

17:58.570 --> 18:00.090
The rest of you, follow me.

18:04.360 --> 18:05.910
Hey, sir.

18:05.910 --> 18:08.080
It's almost time to say 
bye-bye to your lower half.

18:08.080 --> 18:08.820
How do you feel?

18:09.930 --> 18:11.410
Wow!

18:11.410 --> 18:15.120
In recognition of your strong sense 
of justice, I'll let you free!

18:16.840 --> 18:18.850
Use this to call for help.

18:19.410 --> 18:21.270
You lousy scum...

18:21.270 --> 18:25.260
The justice system will destroy you all!

18:26.620 --> 18:28.640
I envy you.

18:29.550 --> 18:33.530
Birds born in a cage don't 
realize they're prisoners.

18:33.910 --> 18:35.170
The prison is here.

18:35.660 --> 18:37.300
In your skull.

18:37.930 --> 18:39.830
We can't escape.

18:41.800 --> 18:44.960
Not from this warm, moist hell.

18:43.350 --> 18:46.310
<b>"Not from this warm, 
moist hell," he says.</b>

18:49.240 --> 18:51.140
Headquarters, sniper team here.

18:51.540 --> 18:53.300
Targets sighted through the window.

18:53.300 --> 18:56.620
However, the targets' faces 
are obscured by white hoods.

18:57.330 --> 18:59.720
The white hoods are the Decay of Angels.

19:00.080 --> 19:01.780
Wait for our signal to fire.

19:01.780 --> 19:03.450
Rescue squad, your status?

19:03.890 --> 19:07.370
An unidentified Gifted flipped 
our armored vehicle over!

19:07.750 --> 19:08.840
What?

19:09.330 --> 19:10.630
Damn it!

19:10.630 --> 19:13.370
Tell intel to pull up 
the Gifted immediately!

19:16.370 --> 19:18.290
Lieutenant, your thoughts?

19:18.830 --> 19:21.660
The hostages are all general 
manager-level dignitaries.

19:22.280 --> 19:24.310
It might be true...

19:25.190 --> 19:28.810
that Decay of Angels 
are government agents.

19:29.480 --> 19:33.310
If that's true, it would be dangerous 
to collaborate with other agencies.

19:34.680 --> 19:36.610
Demand that they finish 
determining the subject

19:36.610 --> 19:38.010
of the hostages' secret meeting faster.

19:38.010 --> 19:38.780
Sir.

19:40.840 --> 19:42.780
Government traitors...

19:43.070 --> 19:45.800
Which arm are Decay of Angels from?

19:47.450 --> 19:50.180
The hostages are beyond this door.

19:50.180 --> 19:52.650
First, we throw in this sonic grenade.

19:53.220 --> 19:55.070
Simultaneously, we use Demon Snow

19:55.070 --> 19:57.680
to decapitate all of the 
perpetrators from behind.

19:57.970 --> 20:01.050
A frontal special ability fight 
would lead to the hostages' deaths.

20:02.250 --> 20:03.800
There's no other way.

20:06.640 --> 20:07.650
It's time.

20:07.650 --> 20:09.050
Press the start button.

20:09.050 --> 20:10.070
Don't!

20:10.070 --> 20:12.220
There's a few more minutes until six!

20:12.220 --> 20:14.450
No, we're right on time.

20:15.300 --> 20:16.600
Also...

20:16.910 --> 20:18.870
Everyone, take off your hoods.

20:18.860 --> 20:21.740
<b>"Take off your hoods,"</b>

20:18.860 --> 20:21.740
<b>said the young man.</b>

20:23.120 --> 20:24.850
Targets are removing their hoods!

20:24.850 --> 20:26.580
We'll see the perpetrators' faces!

20:26.580 --> 20:27.150
Don't miss them!

20:32.100 --> 20:32.870
Dive!

20:34.710 --> 20:37.960
<b>Under the white hoods</b>

20:36.020 --> 20:37.960
<b>were their faces...</b>

20:50.440 --> 20:52.170
What the hell is this?

20:53.890 --> 20:55.640
It's the hostage room.

20:56.050 --> 20:57.170
Impossible...

20:57.170 --> 20:58.720
We haven't opened the door.

20:59.030 --> 21:00.970
Is this the start button?

21:00.970 --> 21:02.240
I'm pressing it?

21:02.630 --> 21:04.180
Welcome.

21:05.080 --> 21:06.860
You're the murderer.

21:07.310 --> 21:09.430
Why are you tied up?

21:09.430 --> 21:11.240
This is my escape.

21:11.240 --> 21:14.250
From the biological brainwashing 
that we call morality.

21:14.250 --> 21:15.630
Hear me!

21:15.630 --> 21:19.050
My scream of free will!

21:22.270 --> 21:23.800
Help me!

21:23.800 --> 21:25.010
Help me, please!

21:25.010 --> 21:26.350
Mr. Tonan!

21:26.350 --> 21:27.960
C-Call for help!

21:27.960 --> 21:29.970
The perpetrator's identity!

21:32.750 --> 21:34.840
I know who the perpetrator is.

21:35.200 --> 21:37.040
<i>The hostages are being cut in half!</i>

21:37.350 --> 21:38.710
You have permission to fire!

21:38.710 --> 21:39.600
Captain!

21:39.600 --> 21:41.320
We've learned that the subject of the meeting

21:41.320 --> 21:44.230
was the publication of the 
Detective Agency's criminal acts.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.110
<i>Kunikida, get out of there!</i>

21:57.110 --> 22:00.860
Apathy and dissatisfaction 
with one's own station...

22:00.860 --> 22:02.080
It's about the Detective Agency!

22:02.080 --> 22:04.300
The Decay of Angels...

22:04.950 --> 22:07.050
is the Armed Detective Agency!

23:37.730 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode: 44
